{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015FLnU95wr9Dt7EBzesHKXW","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Placeholder substitution language\n2\t\n3\tA template is a string. A placeholder is exactly '{{' + name + '}}' where\n4\tname is one or more lowercase letters (regex [a-z]+); anything else,\n5\tincluding braces that do not form such a placeholder, is literal text.\n6\t\n7\t- render(t, ctx) replaces every placeholder with ctx[name], where ctx is\n8\t  a mapping of names to strings.\n9\t- A placeholder whose name is not in ctx is replaced by the empty string.\n10\t- Replacement is a single pass over the template: values are inserted as\n11\t  literal text and are never re-scanned for placeholders.\n12\t- No other transformation is applied.\n13\t\n14\tFunction contract: render(p) with p = {\"template\": t, \"context\": ctx}\n15\treturns the rendered string.\n16\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ee44e816-8bb9-4019-aa9a-8d0e6363eca5","uuid":"357b1e9e-adc1-4484-bf65-c3d6695f2dd3","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:14:36.353Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t07/primary/exec-ws/package/artifacts/render.md","content":"# Placeholder substitution language\n\nA template is a string. A placeholder is exactly '{{' + name + '}}' where\nname is one or more lowercase letters (regex [a-z]+); anything else,\nincluding braces that do not form such a placeholder, is literal text.\n\n- render(t, ctx) replaces every placeholder with ctx[name], where ctx is\n  a mapping of names to strings.\n- A placeholder whose name is not in ctx is replaced by the empty string.\n- Replacement is a single pass over the template: values are inserted as\n  literal text and are never re-scanned for placeholders.\n- No other transformation is applied.\n\nFunction contract: render(p) with p = {\"template\": t, \"context\": ctx}\nreturns the rendered string.\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}}}
